      "title": "Integer Overflow or Wraparound in org.eclipse.jetty.http2:http2-hpack",
      "description": "Affected versions of org.eclipse.jetty.http3:http3-qpack, org.eclipse.jetty:jetty-http, and org.eclipse.jetty.http2:http2-hpack are vulnerable to Integer Overflow Or Wraparound. An attacker can exploit the integer overflow in `MetaDataBuilder.checkSize` to manipulate HTTP/2 HPACK header values, potentially causing buffer overflows and server memory exhaustion by sending crafted headers.",
